{"seq":3,"slug":"integrated-pest-management","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 有害生物综合治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/resource-management/integrated-pest-management","wordCount":1955,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-可持续农业-有害生物综合治理\">研究生 可持续农业 — 有害生物综合治理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>有害生物综合治理（Integrated Pest Management, IPM）是综合运用生物、物理、化学和农艺措施，将有害生物种群密度控制在经济损害水平以下的可持续植保策略。IPM的核心理念不是消灭害虫，而是将其控制在可接受的水平，同时最大限度地减少对环境和非靶标生物的不利影响。FAO将IPM定义为&quot;仔细考虑所有可用的害虫控制技术，整合适当的措施以抑制有害生物种群发展，将化学农药和其他干预措施维持在经济合理且对人类健康和环境风险最小的水平&quot;。</p>\n<p>IPM的基本原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>经济阈值（Economic Threshold, ET）</strong>：需要采取防治措施以防止害虫密度达到经济损害水平的害虫种群密度</li>\n<li><strong>经济损害水平（Economic Injury Level, EIL）</strong>：害虫种群密度达到造成的经济损失等于防治成本的水平</li>\n<li><strong>预防优先（Prevention First）</strong>：通过农艺措施和栖息地管理预防害虫暴发</li>\n<li><strong>监测为基础（Monitoring-based）</strong>：基于田间系统监测做出防治决策</li>\n<li><strong>多策略整合（Multi-tactic Integration）</strong>：生物、物理、化学方法的优化组合</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"经济阈值理论\">经济阈值理论</h3><p>经济阈值是IPM决策的定量基础。EIL的计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EIL = \\frac{C}{V \\times I \\times D \\times K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为单位面积防治成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 为作物商品价值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>单位产量），</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">/单位产量），</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位产量），</span></span></span></span></span>I<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>为害虫单位密度造成的产量损失比例，</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">为害虫单位密度造成的产量损失比例，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为害虫单位密度造成的产量损失比例，</span></span></span></span></span>D<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>为损害函数（产量损失与害虫密度的关系），</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">为损害函数（产量损失与害虫密度的关系），</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为损害函数（产量损失与害虫密度的关系），</span></span></span></span></span>K$ 为防治效果系数。</p>\n<p>经济阈值（ET）通常设定为EIL的某一比例（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span> EIL），为防治行动留出时间裕度。ET随作物市场价格、防治成本和害虫增长速率动态变化——当作物价格上升时，ET降低（更早采取防治措施）；当农药价格上升时，ET升高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"害虫监测技术\">害虫监测技术</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监测方法</th>\n<th>靶标害虫类型</th>\n<th>定量能力</th>\n<th>空间尺度</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目测调查</td>\n<td>各类害虫</td>\n<td>定量（密度）</td>\n<td>田块</td>\n<td>基础调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性信息素诱捕器</td>\n<td>鳞翅目成虫</td>\n<td>半定量（趋势）</td>\n<td>田块-区域</td>\n<td>迁飞监测、发生期预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄/蓝色粘板</td>\n<td>蚜虫、粉虱、蓟马</td>\n<td>定量</td>\n<td>田块</td>\n<td>设施蔬菜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灯光诱捕</td>\n<td>多种趋光性昆虫</td>\n<td>定量</td>\n<td>区域</td>\n<td>区域测报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遥感监测</td>\n<td>大面积虫害</td>\n<td>定性-半定量</td>\n<td>景观-区域</td>\n<td>蝗虫、迁飞性害虫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分子检测</td>\n<td>病毒、细菌、真菌</td>\n<td>定量（qPCR）</td>\n<td>样品</td>\n<td>病害早期诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>性信息素（Sex Pheromone）诱捕</strong>是鳞翅目害虫监测最有效的工具。合成性信息素诱芯释放的化学信号吸引雄虫飞入诱捕器，通过诱捕量的时间动态判断成虫发生期和发生量，指导最佳防治时机的确定。在棉铃虫、小菜蛾和桃小食心虫等主要害虫的监测中已高度成熟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生物防治策略\">生物防治策略</h3><p><strong>天敌保护和增强</strong>：通过农田生境管理维持和提升天敌种群。措施包括：在田边种植蜜源植物为寄生蜂提供补充营养（功能性植物多样性, FPB）、减少广谱农药使用保护天敌存活、设置人工巢箱为捕食性昆虫和鸟类提供栖息地。</p>\n<p><strong>天敌释放（Augmentative Biocontrol）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>淹没式释放（Inundative release）：大量释放天敌以直接控制害虫，如赤眼蜂卵寄生控制玉米螟</li>\n<li>接种式释放（Inoculative release）：少量释放天敌建立种群，由其后代持续控制害虫</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中国赤眼蜂防治玉米螟是全球最大规模的天敌释放计划之一，年释放面积超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span></span></span></span></span> 万公顷，对玉米螟卵寄生率可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>微生物农药</strong>：Bt（苏云金芽孢杆菌）制剂、绿僵菌和白僵菌等虫生真菌、核型多角体病毒（NPV）等。微生物农药的选择性强、环境相容性好，但通常起效较慢且受环境条件影响大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"化学防治的合理使用\">化学防治的合理使用</h3><p>IPM不排斥化学农药，而是将其作为&quot;最后防线&quot;合理使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>精准施药</strong>：基于监测数据和经济阈值确定施药时机和区域，避免&quot;预防性&quot;盲目用药</li>\n<li><strong>选择性农药优先</strong>：优先使用对天敌和传粉者低毒的选择性农药</li>\n<li><strong>抗药性管理</strong>：实施杀虫剂抗性管理（IRM）策略，轮换不同作用机制的药剂。IRAC（国际杀虫剂抗性行动委员会）将杀虫剂按作用机制分为30多个类群</li>\n<li><strong>精准施药技术</strong>：变量喷雾、静电喷雾和无人机航空施药提高了农药沉积率，减少了漂移和浪费</li>\n</ul>\n<p>害虫抗药性演化遵循选择压力模型。在持续单一药剂选择下，抗性等位基因频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的变化近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{t+1} = \\frac{q_t \\cdot W_{RR} + p_t \\cdot h \\cdot W_{RS}}{p_t^2 \\cdot W_{SS} + 2p_tq_t \\cdot W_{RS} + q_t^2 \\cdot W_{RR}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3032em;vertical-align:-0.9318em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" st